  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gloom-sh/gloomberb/zipball/v0.15.8",
  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Charts keep working after the close.** Intraday and 1D charts of US and non-US listings no longer go empty or fail once the market closes, or the next morning before the new session's first delayed bar arrives. (#1279, #1281, #1284)\n- **1D shows the latest session.** A 1D chart covers the listing's latest trading session in the venue's own time instead of a rolling 24 hours, and US listings get an `Extended hours` toggle for pre-market and after-hours bars. (#1279)\n- **Oil and gas inventories in `DOE`.** The EIA's weekly crude, product and gas storage numbers against their five-year ranges, charted over the year, with `NGS` opening the gas tab. (#1288)\n- **Onboarding in the listing's currency.** Positions added at first run take the listing's currency, with a Currency field to change it, and Avg cost clears after each add. (#1285)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Charts: a listing a few days old charts the range it has traded instead of a two-point line, and 30m on 3M charts the intraday history that exists instead of nothing. (#1284, #1287)\n- Deleting a watchlist also removes it from its tickers. (#1283)\n- ROE reads N/M when equity changes sign, instead of figures like 15,367%. (#1286)\n- Exchange suffixes like `TTALO.HEL` resolve to the listing. (#1285)\n- Section headings are set in bright, bold title case. (#1273, #1280)\n- A fullscreen pane no longer has the floating border drawn through it. (#1282)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.15.7...v0.15.8)\n"
}
